    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc3fb4efe2483904aa8c2a96",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这特殊程度超乎我的想像……！外观特殊的碎内脏香肠与\n蓝纹起司……看着面前这些陌生食材，我不禁全身僵硬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9657625c28ef54665689fc527075181480a852810f941605ae84f2878f4231c6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
